size 40 7
start
keys G o
type xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx
frame typing
tick 1m
frame minute
write todo.txt changed
tick 50ms
frame outside
keys <Esc>
keys g g
keys 4 j
keys A
write todo.txt line-changed
tick 50ms
frame refused
